<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 409)</h2>
<p><b>License grants for reviewers.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Session ▸ Issue a License…</b> (on authorized machines) writes a signed 6-month, 1-year or 3-year license file — for the reviewer who should never hit a pause.</li>
<li>Asobi Review copies now stay licensed through use: any review invitation, session join, or license file renews them; a copy that goes a month without one pauses and asks — and any valid key brings it straight back.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
